  "description": "Designed for kids - The GKS Lumios is the perfect electric scooter for kids. Attracted by the vibrant colors and neon LED wheels it's sure to be their favorite toy. The light weight frame is made from Aircraft-Grade Aluminum, and features a fire retardent deck. The GKS Lumios is easy to use and has no external batteries or cables.\n\nNeon LED wheel - Your kids will be thrilled when they see their new glowing electric scooter. The front wheel now has a built in neon led that shines bright and stands out. Upgraded Battery and Motor - More time to play means more fun. Ride up to 4.8 miles per charge using the new 20% larger battery. The GKS Lumios features a 200W motor that reaches a safe max speed of 7.5mph. Adjustable Handlebars - Now the Lumios can grow with your child so they can enjoy it for years to come. Easily adjust the handle bars to heights between 32.5\"- 37\" Bringing Family Together - The electric kick scooter is perfect for kids ages 6-12 up to 154lbs. The Assembly is simple and can be done together. Quickly install the few screws and your scooter is ready to go! Supervision while riding is recommended.",
